KDD-2004 Call for Industrial/Government Track Papers, deadline
February 20, 2004

KDD-2004 
THE TENTH ACM SIGKDD INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE 
ON KNOWLEDGE DISCOVERY AND DATA MINING 

August 22-25, 2004 
Seattle, WA, USA 

