if(...) is not vectorized. This means that "if" is expecting either TRUE 
or FALSE and not c(TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, ...). I usually fix this by using 
"any" or "all", as in:

if(all(abs(wsold[good] - wsnew[good]) < wstol/10)) { ... }
   ^^^

Hope this helps.

Sundar

