My solution produces -2 for if no 1's are found.  To fix that, consider 
the following: 

     n.zeros <-

     function(x){

         n <- (regexpr("1", x)-1)

         n <- ifelse(n<0, nchar(x), n)

         n                  
     }

> digits <- 
c("00000000000000000000000010001010111100011111111111111111111",

   "101", "000")

> n.zeros(digits)

[1] 24  0  3

attr(, "match.length"):

[1]  1  1 -1

hope this helps.  spencer graves

